{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":"2026-06-11T11:27:15.122Z","tool_name":"replace","tool_id":"replace__idh49tog","parameters":{"old_string":"fn get_li_decimal_index(dom: &Dom, li_node: NodeId, list_node: NodeId) -> usize {\n    let mut lis = Vec::new();\n    find_li_descendants(dom, list_node, list_node, &mut lis);\n    lis.iter()\n        .position(|&id| id == li_node)\n        .map(|pos| pos + 1)\n        .unwrap_or(1)\n}","allow_multiple":false,"file_path":"src/layout/mod.rs","new_string":"// spec: https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/grouping-content.html#the-ol-element\nfn get_li_decimal_index(dom: &Dom, li_node: NodeId, list_node: NodeId) -> i64 {\n    let mut lis = Vec::new();\n    find_li_descendants(dom, list_node, list_node, &mut lis);\n\n    let reversed = dom.get_attribute(list_node, \"reversed\").is_some();\n    let start_val = dom.get_attribute(list_node, \"start\")\n        .map(|s| s.trim())\n        .and_then(|s| s.parse::<i64>().ok());\n\n    let start_value = if let Some(start) = start_val {\n        start\n    } else if reversed {\n        lis.len() as i64\n    } else {\n        1\n    };\n\n    let mut current = start_value;\n    for &child in &lis {\n        if let Some(val_str) = dom.get_attribute(child, \"value\") {\n            if let Ok(val) = val_str.trim().parse::<i64>() {\n                current = val;\n            }\n        }\n        if child == li_node {\n            return current;\n        }\n        current += if reversed { -1 } else { 1 };\n    }\n\n    1\n}","instruction":"Refactor get_li_decimal_index to return i64 and support `<ol start>`, `<ol reversed>`, and `<li value>` attributes per the HTML specification."}}
